  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOMEN IN BUSINESS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Female presence in the business community is increasingly more visible and becoming more dominant. The &#x2018;
&#x2018;Women in Business&#x2019; wants to stimulate women in the private sector and inspire young female professionals
to create a meaningful career path. The activities under the Women in the Business collective are a tool to
connect to like-minded professionals, exchange experiences, and join the sparkling dialogues on relevant
issues. The flagship element of this project is the mentorship program, where senior female professionals are
connected to junior female entrepreneurs for their guidance.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
