   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Report Women in Business</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WIB 2025 cohort successfully ran from July 2025 to December 2025 and was designed to empower women-led SMEs primarily within the horticulture and agro-processing sectors. The program provided a structured framework for mentorship, technical training, exhibitions, and networking. As of the final quarter of 2025, the program has fostered a resilient community of 40 women entrepreneurs, guiding them through the complexities of enhancing operational efficiency, market positioning, enhancing financial literacy, improving leadership, scaling operations, and achieving export readiness.</narrative>
   </description>
